# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Each Campaign must contain at least one Mailer Record.

---

## Rule 2

A Mailer Record may only belong to one active Campaign.

---

## Rule 3

Completed Campaigns become read-only.

---

## Rule 4

Campaign cost is automatically calculated.

Formula

```
Printing
+ Postage
+ Processing
+ Miscellaneous
=
Total Campaign Cost
```

---

## Rule 5

ROI updates automatically whenever a linked Deal closes.

